.Dd April 2, 2026
.Dt VI 1
.Os Substrate
.Sh NAME
.Nm vi
.Nd full-screen visual text editor
.Sh SYNOPSIS
.Nm
.Op Fl RrsSv
.Op Fl c Ar command
.Op Fl t Ar tag
.Op Ar +command
.Op Ar file
.Op Ar file ...
.Sh DESCRIPTION
The
.Nm
utility is the full-screen visual frontend for Substrate's shared
.Pa usr.lib/exvi
editor core.
It provides a BSD-first
visual editing interface over the same buffer, command, tag, recovery,
and option
machinery used by
.Xr ex 1 .
.Pp
Normal mode, insert mode, replace mode, search prompts, and visual
.Ql \&:
command entry are supported.
The visual command line exposes the same documented command set and
.Ic :set
options as standalone
.Xr ex 1 .
.Pp
The current visual frontend supports:
.Bl -tag -width indent
.It movement
.Cm h
.Cm j
.Cm k
.Cm l ,
.Cm 0 ,
.Cm ^ ,
.Cm $ ,
.Cm _
.Cm g_
.Cm gg ,
.Cm G ,
.Cm +
.Cm - ,
.Cm H ,
.Cm M ,
.Cm L ,
.Cm Ctrl-F ,
.Cm Ctrl-B ,
.Cm Ctrl-D ,
.Cm Ctrl-U ,
.Cm Ctrl-E ,
.Cm Ctrl-Y ,
.Cm zz ,
.Cm z<Enter> ,
.Cm z-
.Ql z.
.Cm zt ,
.Cm zb
.It word and text motions
.Cm w
.Cm b
.Cm e ,
.Cm W
.Cm B
.Cm E ,
.Cm ge ,
.Cm gE ,
.Ql (
.Ql ) ,
.Ql {
.Ql } ,
.Cm [[
.Cm ]]
.Cm []
.Cm ][ ,
.Cm %
.Cm *
.Cm #
.It find and mark motions
.Cm f
.Cm F
.Cm t
.Cm T ,
.Ql ; ,
.Ql , ,
.Cm ' Ns Ar mark
.Cm ` Ns Ar mark ,
.Cm m Ns Ar mark
.It search and prompt entry
.Ql /
.Ql ?
