.Cm ~ ,
line shifts with
.Cm >>
and
.Cm <<
and delete, change, and yank with the supported motion families
.It put, undo, and redo
.Cm p
.Cm P ,
.Cm u ,
.Cm U
(the current line as it was when it became the current line),
.Cm Ctrl-R
.It tag and mode switching
